        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions PNR03, Black Snake Skin Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis ultra modern door pull from First Impressions' Pioneer Collection features a carbon Fiber grip decorated with a snake skin pattern. This black grip can be paired with contemporary stainless steel mounts in either polished stainless steel or satin stainless steel. Choose from 18 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths with thru-bolt mounting, surface mounting, or back-to-back mounting. The Contemporary Snake Skin Door Pull is a great way to add a little texture to the sometimes sterile environments that modern decor can have.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text\">\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions PNR03 Modern Snake Skin Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Carbon Fiber</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-PNR03-specifications.pdf?v=1704262329\"><b>First Impressions PNR03 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>FII-PNR03018:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.19\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.68\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>FII-PNR03024:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.19\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.68\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>FII-PNR03036:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.19\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.68\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b> up to 8 feet. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Contemporary Snake Skin Door Pull",
                "description": "This ultra modern door pull from First Impressions' Pioneer Collection features a carbon Fiber grip decorated with a snake skin pattern. This black grip can be paired with contemporary stainless steel mounts in either polished stainless steel or satin stainless steel. Choose from 18 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths with thru-bolt mounting, surface mounting, or back-to-back mounting. The Contemporary Snake Skin Door Pull is a great way to add a little texture to the sometimes sterile environments that modern decor can have.",
                "keywords": "Pioneer Collection Series 3 Door Pulls, Contemporary Snake Skin Door Pulls, First Impressions PNR03, FII-PNR03 modern door pulls, contemporary door pulls, First Impressions Pioneer 3 pulls, 24 inch door pulls, 36 inch door pulls, 18 inch door pulls, First Impressions PNR03 Modern Snake Skin Door Handles, Black Snake Skin Handles, black door pulls, black door handles,"
